    fix(daemon): serialize cold-start spawn with an O_EXCL gate (daemon-spawn-mutex-1)
    
    ensure_bind now claims an atomic create_new spawn-gate before launching the
    daemon, so parallel open/view_file invocations can't each spawn one (two
    daemons fighting over the port + SQLite registry, loser orphaned). Only the
    gate holder spawns (re-checking under the gate); others wait for readiness. A
    stale gate (dead spawner) is stolen after 15s; an unusable gate degrades to the
    old unguarded spawn so auto-start never regresses. Resolves the double-spawn
    race from review-260716-4unreviewed.

